WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.619
Mobile EV charging companies: join The Motoring Central, and let us bring the call-outs to you.

00:00:09.004 --> 00:00:18.114
Drivers come to us for everything their car needs. So when an electric car runs out of charge, they find you here, see your price, and book you in a couple of minutes.

00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:26.905
And it's not just rescues. Drivers also book top-ups at home or at work, so you can fill the quiet hours with planned jobs too.

00:00:27.684 --> 00:00:40.447
You set your own call-out charge and your price per mile. Customers see the full price before they book, and you keep what you charge, less 5% plus VAT during our launch. Or go Pro, and pay nothing per job.

00:00:41.301 --> 00:00:52.243
Now, our automatic booking system. Set your weekly hours once, and the bookings come in by themselves. In your hours, you're available for out-of-charge rescues without pressing a thing.

00:00:52.977 --> 00:01:04.260
Tell us how many vans you run, and how long a job takes. We never book more jobs at once than you have vans. And when you're full, the driver is offered your next free time, so the job isn't lost.

00:01:05.037 --> 00:01:15.324
Every job lands on your dashboard with the location, a map link, the plug type and the battery level. Tap on my way, arrived, and job done, and the driver is kept up to date.

00:01:16.436 --> 00:01:26.374
Every job is paid for when it's booked. If a driver cancels after you've set off, you keep your call-out charge. And your monthly statement shows every job and every payout.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:39.225
Joining takes about five minutes. Add your depot postcode, how far you travel, your connectors and your rates. Then upload your insurance and photo ID. We check your documents, and you're live.

00:01:39.511 --> 00:01:43.365
Join the network today, at motoringcentral.co.uk.
